      "writtenOn": "2023-02-02T00:22:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you explain why there\u0027s both a lock and a \"locked\" flag here? It looks like an anti-pattern.\n\nUnless there\u0027s something happening here that\u0027s not clear to me, I think you should use the mutex only because it will save on spurious thread wakeups and prevents priority inversion (because zephyr will give the holder of a mutex a priority boost if a higher priority thread is blocked on it).",
      "revId": "e7d1439c4d877805aecd05acaf64e5c4b7fd265b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "77e8aad2_25b8fdcf",
