        "id": 1352056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-02T00:47:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right, my intention with `state_lock` is to prevent `run` actions from executing, is better to lock the thread instead, and let the OS boost priorities.",
